          "text": "### Wayfinding readiness — July 25, 2025\n\nThe **Wayfinding Checklist** in the *NGH Main Campus Clinic Relocation Operations Workbook* contains **45 actual controls (WF-001–WF-045)**, excluding headings, guidance, blank lines, and other non-control content.\n\n| Measure | Count |\n|---|---:|\n| Total controls | **45** |\n| Marked complete | **22** |\n| Incomplete | **23** |\n| Completion rate | **48.9%** |\n| Critical-priority incomplete controls | **10** |\n\nThe 23 incomplete controls comprise **14 In Progress, 6 Not Started, and 3 Blocked**.\n\n**All currently blocked controls:**\n\n| Control ID | Affected relocated service |\n|---|---|\n| **WF-028** | Endoscopy |\n| **WF-032** | Pulmonary |\n| **WF-036** | General Surgery |\n\n*Read-only review; no workbook changes made.*",
